// | 解答例            | {{attach_anchor(gw4_page_rank_ans.ipynb)}}              | [[github|https://github.com/daddygongon/jupyter_num_calc/blob/main/symbolic_math/group_works/gw4_page_rank_ans.ipynb]] |

